WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
At midnight Alex sees an Instagram ad and taps Send message.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Customer: Hi! I saw your Instagram ad. Can I book for tomorrow?

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.000
Business AI: Hi Alex! Of course. What would you like to book?  Consultation · ₹1,000 Seat booking · ₹500 Service visit · ₹1,500

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.500
Customer: A consultation, please.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.000
Business AI: Here are tomorrow’s available times. Tap one to choose.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.500
Customer: 10:00 AM works for me.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:25.000
Business AI: Please review your booking:  Consultation Tomorrow · 10:00 AM Total · ₹1,000  Shall I confirm these details?

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.500
Customer: Yes, confirm please.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:32.000
Business AI: Your slot is held while you pay. Choose a secure payment option.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.500
Customer: Send me the payment link.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.000
Business AI: Razorpay payment link Consultation · ₹1,000  Open payment link ↗ DEMO ONLY · no payment collected

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.500
Business AI: Payment verified ✓  You’re booked for tomorrow at 10:00 AM. Booking ID: DEMO-001  We’ll remind you before your appointment.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:46.000
Business AI: Your confirmation is recorded. The owner has received your booking details.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.500
Customer: Can I cancel or change my appointment?

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:53.000
Business AI: I’ve sent your request to the owner. Once approved, you can choose another slot or request a refund under our cancellation policy.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.500
Business AI: The owner approved your cancellation. Your original slot is released.  Reschedule or request a refund?

00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:00.000
Customer: Let’s reschedule to 3:00 PM.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.500
Business AI: 3:00 PM is available. Your paid booking has been moved.  Tomorrow · 3:00 PM DEMO-001 · Confirmed  The owner and booking sheet are updated.

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:07.000
Customer: My plans changed again. Could I request a refund?

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.500
Business AI: The owner has approved your refund request. We’ll notify you when Razorpay confirms it has been processed.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:14.000
Business AI: Refund processed ✓  Your appointment is cancelled. The refund will reach your original payment method according to the provider’s timeline.  The booking sheet and owner are updated.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Owner receives a WhatsApp notification and the booking is recorded in Google Sheets. Live operation requires connected providers.
